WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:02.834
-Hey, Fred! -Hey, Jimmy!

00:00:02.834 --> 00:00:04.501
-The show's about to start! You ready?!

00:00:04.501 --> 00:00:06.234
-Yeah, let's go! -Let's do this, buddy.

00:00:06.234 --> 00:00:08.133
Oh! -Ah!

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:09.767
-W-We're stuck!

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:11.367
-We're stuck in a door frame?

00:00:11.367 --> 00:00:13.968
-I can't -- I can't get out.

00:00:13.968 --> 00:00:16.133
-Help! We're stuck! -Help! Help!

00:00:16.133 --> 00:00:17.834
We're stuck in the door! -Can someone help, please?

00:00:17.834 --> 00:00:19.200
-Help! -Please?!

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:20.834
-Help! We're stuck! -Please help.

00:00:20.834 --> 00:00:22.300
-Fred -- Fred, are you falling asleep?

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.267
Fred, wake up! Wake up! Fred!

00:00:24.267 --> 00:00:27.801
-[Groans] Sorry. I think the body heat made me tired.

00:00:27.801 --> 00:00:29.300
-I'm getting hungry. -Me too.

00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:30.667
I have a granola bar in case

00:00:30.667 --> 00:00:33.767
I ever get stuck in a door frame, but I can't reach it.

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:36.000
-Oh, gosh. How are we gonna get out?!

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.234
-I think we're gonna have to cut off your arm.

00:00:38.234 --> 00:00:39.968
-Why do we have to cut off my arm?

00:00:39.968 --> 00:00:42.167
-Because I'm the one with the bone saw.

00:00:42.167 --> 00:00:45.033
-Hold on. Your shoulder pads. They're inflatable, right?

00:00:45.033 --> 00:00:47.234
-Of course they are.

00:00:47.234 --> 00:00:48.400
[ Pop, air hissing ]

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.601
[ Both sigh ]

00:00:49.601 --> 00:00:50.968
[ Both chuckle ]

00:00:50.968 --> 00:00:52.334
-Let's go do the show.

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:53.801
-Oh, wait! I forgot my granola bar.

00:00:53.801 --> 00:00:54.968
-Oh, I'll get it.

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:57.300
Aah! Come on! -Come on!

